  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Perform JSON-to-JSON transformations with ease",
    "splashDescription": "This connector streamlines integrations where JSON data re-structuring is a recurring requirement, offering a powerful and flexible solution by combining Camunda's connector extensibility with JOLT's transformation capabilities. It provides the power of JOLT transformations within the easy-to-use, reusable, and scalable framework of Camunda 8 connectors, making complex data mapping tasks more accessible and efficient for process automation.",
